====Extra Hits====
{{Main|Extra Hit}}
The following [[Decree|Decrees]] can apply Extra Hits to abilities, including ones normally unaffected by Universal Weapon Bonuses.
* {{Decree|Cloak and Dagger}} - also applies self-damage and {{D|Slash}} status as normal.
* {{Decree|Critical Frost}} - usable through e.g. {{Arcane|Arcane Avenger}} or {{WF|Gyre}}'s passive.


