=== Notes ===
* Abilities with "N/A" as their listed critical chance are completely incapable of landing critical hits, even when buffed with flat critical chance bonuses like {{Arcane|Arcane Avenger}}.
** Most listed abilities have 0% critical chance, meaning they '''require''' a flat critical chance bonus in order to be able to critically hit.
* If an ability affected by universal weapon bonuses has status chance greater than 0%, it can apply elements that are added via elemental buffs ({{M|Valence Formation}}, {{A|Nourish}}, and {{A|Plunder}}). The added element will compete with the base element of the ability for which element will be proc'd when a status is applied.
** Guaranteed status procs on the other hand '''cannot''' be changed by these elemental buffs.

